# ===============================
*.sock
*.pid.lock

# ===============================
# 💥 빌드시 남는 잡다한 캐시/로그 (정리용)
# ===============================
deploy/dev/=
deploy/dev/CACHED
deploy/dev/[*/
deploy/dev/exporting
deploy/dev/naming
deploy/dev/transferring
deploy/dev/writing
*.zip